  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.4810 describes requirements for data security of heterogeneous Internet of things (IoT) devices under specific scenarios to provide a general reference recommendation and to ensure IoT data safety. Deploying existing data security solutions to IoT presents challenges because of limited hardware and software resources, IoT device management and IoT deployment specific scenarios.</abstract>
